{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"一、三年，春王正月，郊牛之口傷，改卜牛。牛死，乃不郊，猶三望。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"其言之何？緩也。曷為不復卜？養牲養二卜。帝牲不吉，則扳稷牲而卜之。帝牲在于滌三月，於稷者唯具是視。郊曷為必祭稷？王者必以其祖配。王者則曷為必以其祖配？自內出者無匹不行，自外至者無主不止。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"二、葬匡王。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"三、楚子伐賁渾戎。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"四、夏，楚人侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"五、秋，赤狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"六、宋師圍曹。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"七、冬十月丙戌，鄭伯蘭卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_117_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_117","textTraditional":"八、葬鄭繆公。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}